# 统一换行符：仓库内一律使用 LF，检出时按平台处理
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做换行符转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.apk binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
*.pdf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mp3 binary
